---
description: FastAPI backend layering and contracts
globs: apps/api/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Layers: api/routes (HTTP only) → services (rules) → repositories (SQL) → models. Schemas = Pydantic I/O.
- Endpoints and payloads must match `.claude/api-contract.md`; tables match `.claude/data-model.md`.
- Every write to questions/aliases/preferences/settings bumps `users.kb_version` in the same transaction.
- `app/matching` reads `packages/contracts/matching/rules.json`; `tests/test_matching` runs `vectors.json`.
- LLM access only through the `LlmProvider` port; model name from settings. Keep the hallucination guard
  in `app/llm/contract.py`.
- Every AI call and fill event writes a `usage_events` row.
